{"3181940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Potyguara Verse", "steam_appid": 3181940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Potyguara Verse: Explore, Discover, and Connect in a New Virtual Universe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Potyguara Verse</strong> is an innovative virtual reality platform that blends <strong>entertainment, culture, and exploration</strong> in an interactive and immersive environment. Inspired by the beautiful city of <strong>Natal (RN)</strong>, the game allows you to explore iconic tourist spots, participate in cultural events, and connect with other players—all from the comfort of your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you <strong>don’t just play—you live a unique experience</strong>, immersing yourself in Potiguar culture in an interactive way. Discover <strong>digitally recreated historical and natural landmarks</strong>, participate in cultural events, and engage with a vibrant community. By using a <strong>virtual reality headset</strong>, you can venture through <strong>captivating environments, engaging minigames, and unique experiences</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎭 <strong>Immersive Exploration:</strong> Visit <strong>Rio Grande do Norte’s</strong> most famous landmarks and discover new scenery with every visit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 <strong>Cultural Events:</strong> Participate in <strong>artistic and cultural experiences</strong> within the virtual environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗣️ <strong>Social Interaction:</strong> Meet other players, make new friends, and join <strong>multiplayer events that bring people together from around the world</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Diverse Minigames:</strong> Test your skills in <strong>interactive challenges</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>Potyguara Verse</strong>, cult